  "scientific_limits": {
    "en": "[\"Selected specimen is mineral-filled, not an open pristine living shell. Thin lost lip and internal lumen unknown; no invented internal depth.\", \"Fine apex/protoconch details below model scale may be simplified. Do not enlarge tiny larval features for decoration.\", \"Five reference views constrain exterior; small damaged regions may be smoothed conservatively but no idealized symmetry. Colour is artistic stone, photographs are grayscale.\"] {\"unit\": \"metre\", \"target_X\": 0.0339, \"target_Y\": 0.0255, \"target_Z\": 0.026, \"published_measurements_mm\": {\"ds\": 33.9, \"ws\": 25.5, \"hs\": 26.0, \"wa\": 24.6, \"ha\": 17.3}, \"evidence\": \"Mazaev2021 p896 table row5489/16-4; Fig9f defines axes. X maps diameter ds, Y maps width ws in upper view, Z maps shell height hs. Aperture wa/ha measured along its own oblique axes, not direct worldX/Z extents.\", \"tolerance\": \"About±8% for simplified overall silhouette; these are design limits not measurement error estimates.\"} {\"original_field\": [\"devonian\"], \"original_note\": \"The era is a representative planning interval, not a full stratigraphic range or a coexistence claim.\", \"selected_field\": [\"carboniferous\"], \"reason\": \"Same-genus P.vetustum specimen independently identified in earlyCarboniferous deposits; preserve original morphology, never relabel specimenDevonian.\", \"root_review\": \"2026-10-22T20:55:49Z allowed same-genus documented correction; independentQA must confirm match.\"}",
    "zh": "原创低多边形研究；形态、尺度及不确定性严格以本次已核参考为界。原始限定：[\"Selected specimen is mineral-filled, not an open pristine living shell. Thin lost lip and internal lumen unknown; no invented internal depth.\", \"Fine apex/protoconch details below model scale may be simplified. Do not enlarge tiny larval features for decoration.\", \"Five reference views constrain exterior; small damaged regions may be smoothed conservatively but no idealized symmetry. Colour is artistic stone, photographs are grayscale.\"] {\"unit\": \"metre\", \"target_X\": 0.0339, \"target_Y\": 0.0255, \"target_Z\": 0.026, \"published_measurements_mm\": {\"ds\": 33.9, \"ws\": 25.5, \"hs\": 26.0, \"wa\": 24.6, \"ha\": 17.3}, \"evidence\": \"Mazaev2021 p896 table row5489/16-4; Fig9f defines axes. X maps diameter ds, Y maps width ws in upper view, Z maps shell height hs. Aperture wa/ha measured along its own oblique axes, not direct worldX/Z extents.\", \"tolerance\": \"About±8% for simplified overall silhouette; these are design limits not measurement error estimates.\"} {\"original_field\": [\"devonian\"], \"original_note\": \"The era is a representative planning interval, not a full stratigraphic range or a coexistence claim.\", \"selected_field\": [\"carboniferous\"], \"reason\": \"Same-genus P.vetustum specimen independently identified in earlyCarboniferous deposits; preserve original morphology, never relabel specimenDevonian.\", \"root_review\": \"2026-10-22T20:55:49Z allowed same-genus documented correction; independentQA must confirm match.\"}"
  },
